---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import PickupBanner from '../components/PickupBanner.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { business, money, MACBOOK_BATTERY_PRICE, MACBOOK_OTHER_PRICE, KEYBOARD_PRICE, SCREEN_PRICE, standardDiagnostic, policies, BOOK_HREF } from '../config/site';

const crumbs = [{ name: 'Computer Repair London', href: '/computer-repair-london' }, { name: 'MacBook Repair' }];

const batterySigns = [
  'Battery drains quickly or the MacBook shuts down when unplugged',
  'A “Service Battery” or similar battery warning',
  'Battery swells, the trackpad lifts or the case bulges',
  'The MacBook only works while plugged in',
];
const others = [
  'MacBook screen replacement',
  'MacBook keyboard replacement',
  'Storage upgrades, where the model allows',
  'Internal cleaning for heat and fan noise',
  'Diagnosis of a MacBook that won’t start or charge',
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`MacBook Repair London Ontario | ${business.name}`}
  description="MacBook battery replacement and other MacBook repairs in London, Ontario. Free local pickup and return delivery, clear labour prices and a quotation before any work."
  path="/macbook-repair-london"
  breadcrumbs={crumbs}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumbs items={crumbs} />
      <h1>MacBook repair in London, Ontario</h1>
      <p class="lead">We replace MacBook batteries and handle other MacBook repairs. We collect it, diagnose it, quote it and only start once you approve.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href={BOOK_HREF}>Book a MacBook Repair</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/pricing">View Pricing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <PickupBanner />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0" aria-labelledby="mac-battery">
    <div class="container split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Most requested</p>
        <h2 id="mac-battery">MacBook battery replacement</h2>
        <p class="price-tag" style="font-size:2.2rem;line-height:1.1">{money(MACBOOK_BATTERY_PRICE)} <small>labour, plus the battery</small></p>
        <p class="muted">The battery price depends on your model and is shown on your quotation before you approve.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>A tired MacBook battery is one of the most common reasons a MacBook stops being portable. A new battery restores it to going unplugged all day. Signs it’s time:</p>
        <ul class="check-list">{batterySigns.map((i) => <li>{i}</li>)}</ul>
        <div class="callout">
          <p><strong>Swollen battery?</strong> Stop using and charging the MacBook and book a repair. A swollen battery is a safety risk and shouldn’t be pressed on or punctured.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="mac-other">
    <div class="container split">
      <div>
        <h2 id="mac-other">Other MacBook repairs</h2>
        <p class="muted">Other MacBook repairs start from {money(MACBOOK_OTHER_PRICE)} labour. MacBook screen replacement is {money(SCREEN_PRICE)} and keyboard replacement {money(KEYBOARD_PRICE)}, the same as other laptops. Parts, shipping and applicable taxes are quoted separately.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <ul class="benefits">
          {others.map((o) => (
            <li><span class="tick"><Icon name="check" size={18} /></span><span><strong>{o}</strong></span></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What to expect for your model</h2>
      <p>MacBooks differ a lot between models and years. Some parts are easy to swap; on others the memory or storage is built into the board and can’t be upgraded. Add your MacBook model (for example “MacBook Pro 13-inch, 2019”) to the repair request, and we confirm what is possible, which parts are needed and the total in your quotation.</p>
      <p>The {money(standardDiagnostic.price)} diagnostic comes first, and nothing is repaired without your approval. {policies.dataDisclaimer}</p>
      <p>Using a Windows laptop instead? See <a href="/laptop-repair-london">laptop repair</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand heading="Get your MacBook back to full charge." text="Send a repair request with your MacBook model and a preferred pickup date." button="Request a Repair" />
</BaseLayout>
